OL,3,GNEWSAAlice Webb's family approve of new
OL,4,Acosmetic laws
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman who died after
OL,7,Fhaving a liquid Brazilian Butt Lift
OL,8,F(BBL) has said they believe new rules
OL,9,Fintroduced by the government to
OL,10,Fcrackdown on "cosmetic cowboys" will
OL,11,Fspare other families the same
OL,12,Fheartbreak they experienced.
OL,14,FAlice Webb, a 33-year-old mother of
OL,15,Ffive, died after having the cosmetic
OL,16,Fprocedure at a salon in Gloucester in
OL,17,F2024.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
