OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAAlice Webb's family approve of new
OL,4,Acosmetic laws
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the new rules, treatments that
OL,7,Finvolve injecting fillers anywhere
OL,8,Fother than the face, such as BBLs,
OL,9,Fwould be legally defined as cosmetic
OL,10,Fsurgical procedures, meaning they can
OL,11,Fonly be performing by qualified medics.
OL,13,FHealth minister Karin Smyth said: "We
OL,14,Fwant to drive cosmetic cowboys out of
OL,15,Fthe market and raise standards across
OL,16,Fthe board."
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
